  {
   "id": "button-city-136980@major-2026-06-25",
   "gameId": "button-city-136980",
   "displayName": "Button City Update! Run in the arcade!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-06-25T22:38:56.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We've listened to your feedback! Fennel can now run!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "After studying the ancient ways of moving a foot in front of another at a faster pace than a jaunty stroll through intense observation of nature, delving into histories of marathon and hundred meter dashes, and getting yelled at by our parents to pick up the pace or they're leaving us behind we have finally implemented the most requested feature of running in Button City.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Why running? Why now? Why not back then? Why are we here thinking about oranges when we should be talking about running? All are questions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With this new running technology we will sprint towards the future of Fennel the fox moving a little bit faster towards the arcade!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So DO run in the Button City arcade! Just make sure not to trip!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37894276/47ccccbf669c9c1ab946f2cee330dde259e56601.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
